Adapted from Arrangement.kt, Keylines.kt, KeylineList.kt, Strategy.kt, and
KeylineSnapPosition.kt in AndroidX Material 3. Geometry regression cases also
use the corresponding AndroidX carousel host tests. Adapted to Rust for
Tessera's retained layout, clipping, input, and state model on 2026-10-17.

